.570" end="00:16.870">He </span><span begin="00:16.870" end="00:17.680">smiles </span><span begin="00:17.680" end="00:18.940">politely </span><span begin="00:18.940" end="00:19.330">back </span><span begin="00:19.330" end="00:19.540">at </span><span begin="00:19.540" end="00:20.020">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.500" end="00:24.160"><span begin="00:20.500" end="00:20.830">You </span><span begin="00:20.830" end="00:21.460">stare </span><span begin="00:21.460" end="00:22.870">politely </span><span begin="00:22.870" end="00:23.350">right </span><span begin="00:23.350" end="00:23.620">on </span><span begin="00:23.620" end="00:24.160">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.400" end="00:28.450"><span begin="00:24.400" end="00:24.880">Some </span><span begin="00:24.880" end="00:25.630">sort </span><span begin="00:25.630" end="00:25.780">of </span><span begin="00:25.780" end="00:26.650">window </span><span begin="00:26.650" end="00:27.430">to </span><span begin="00:27.430" end="00:27.670">your </span><span begin="00:27.670" end="00:28.450">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.480" end="00:32.410"><span begin="00:28.480" end="00:28.720">As </span><span begin="00:28.720" end="00:29.140">he </span><span begin="00:29.140" end="00:29.620">goes </span><span begin="00:29.620" end="00:30.490">left </span><span begin="00:30.490" end="00:30.700">and </span><span begin="00:30.700" end="00:30.970">you </span><span begin="00:30.970" end="00:31.600">stay </span><span begin="00:31.600" end="00:32.410">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.410" end="00:36.220"><span begin="00:32.410" end="00:33.370">Between </span><span begin="00:33.370" end="00:33.550">the </span><span begin="00:33.550" end="00:34.630">lines </span><span begin="00:34.630" end="00:34.720">of </span><span begin="00:34.720" end="00:35.470">fear </span><span begin="00:35.470" end="00:35.560">and </span><span begin="00:35.560" end="00:36.220">blame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="